  "description": "Park Wu-Ri just wanted his college diploma and his ruthless family off his back. He did not ask to get paired with Choi I-Yeon, an insolent alpha pervert with a habit of getting off in broad daylight. But just as Wu-Ri tries to intimidate him into dropping their shared class, a sudden wave of heat tears through his body, unmasking him as a late-blooming omega. Scenting the slick and panic in the air, I-Yeon closes in with a cruel smile and a question that seals Wu-Ri's fate: does anyone else know what you really are? With his cover blown and his leverage gone, Wu-Ri's quiet campus life is officially over. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
